    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Möbius transformations\n\nA **Möbius transformation** has the form $T(z) = \\dfrac{az + b}{cz + d}$ with $ad - bc \\ne 0$. It takes circles and lines to circles and lines (where \"line\" = \"circle through $\\infty$\"). The set of Möbius transformations forms a group under composition, isomorphic to $\\mathrm{PSL}(2, \\mathbb{C})$.\n\nFamous examples:\n- $T(z) = z + b$ — translation.\n- $T(z) = a z$ with $|a| = 1$ — rotation.\n- $T(z) = 1/z$ — inversion: swaps inside/outside the unit disc.\n- $T(z) = (z - a)/(1 - \\bar a z)$ for $|a| < 1$ — disc automorphism, takes the unit disc to itself.\n\nPlot the image of a grid under $T(z) = 1/z$.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "/* Plot a grid in the upper half plane and its image under z → 1/z */\nn_lines : 6$\nn_pts : 80$\nreal_lines_in : []$  imag_lines_in : []$\nreal_lines_out : [] $ imag_lines_out : []$\n\nfor k : 1 thru n_lines do block([y_const, x_grid, line_in_re, line_in_im, line_out_re, line_out_im],\n  y_const : 0.3 + 0.4 * (k - 1),\n  x_grid : np_to_list(np_linspace(-2, 2, n_pts)),\n  line_in_re : x_grid,\n  line_in_im : map(lambda([xx], y_const), x_grid),\n  /* image: 1/z = (x - iy)/(x² + y²) */\n  line_out_re : map(lambda([xx], xx / (xx^2 + y_const^2)), x_grid),\n  line_out_im : map(lambda([xx], -y_const / (xx^2 + y_const^2)), x_grid),\n  real_lines_in : append(real_lines_in, [[line_in_re, line_in_im]]),\n  real_lines_out : append(real_lines_out, [[line_out_re, line_out_im]]))$\n\nax_draw2d(\n  color=\"lightblue\", line_width=1, name=\"grid (Im z > 0)\",\n  lines(real_lines_in[1][1], real_lines_in[1][2]),\n  color=\"lightblue\",\n  lines(real_lines_in[2][1], real_lines_in[2][2]),\n  color=\"lightblue\",\n  lines(real_lines_in[3][1], real_lines_in[3][2]),\n  color=\"lightblue\",\n  lines(real_lines_in[4][1], real_lines_in[4][2]),\n  color=\"red\", line_width=1.5, name=\"image under 1/z\",\n  lines(real_lines_out[1][1], real_lines_out[1][2]),\n  color=\"red\",\n  lines(real_lines_out[2][1], real_lines_out[2][2]),\n  color=\"red\",\n  lines(real_lines_out[3][1], real_lines_out[3][2]),\n  color=\"red\",\n  lines(real_lines_out[4][1], real_lines_out[4][2]),\n  title=\"Möbius z → 1/z: horizontal lines map to circles\",\n  xlabel=\"Re\", ylabel=\"Im\",\n  grid=true, aspect_ratio=true, showlegend=true\n)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 18,
      "outputs": [
        {
